contentMarkdown:
This belt is made on-demand at your size (if the provider has the right length of course, it can depend on their stock). The metallic parts are all silver-gun with a clean aspect. The leather used is slightly smooth and won't hurt your body if you move a lot.

The pattern on the leather is slightly marble and play a great role in its vintage and classy aspect.

Always ask for your dimensions. Max-lenght is around 120cm but if you need a custom longer size, i’m sure I can find a solution for you! 👌

